<title>HONG KONG: Shougang Int'l interim net down 25.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Shougang Int'l interim net down 25.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   5.2	vs 7.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.0	vs 1.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs 19.33 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    78.83    vs 106.01</p>
<p>    Turnover		     2,802.92 vs 3,838.21</p>
<p>    Company name		 Shougang Concord International</p>
<p>				     Enterprises Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 16-18</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 31</p>
<p>NOTE - Shougang Concord International engages in trading of steel products and construction materials, transportation and shipping, metals processing and property investment. It also makes steel, electrical and electronic products, ferrous and non-ferrous metals, and minerals.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
